:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\"><img alt=\"Gargoyle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gargoyle_02e1f9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyle</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">65 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Potato\">Potato</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Stone Wing (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-5× Strawberry (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Battle Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morning%20Star\">Morning Star</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Tooth%20Chain\">Wolf Tooth Chain</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Marble%20Rock\">Piece of Marble Rock</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Shiny Stone (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Club%20Ring\">Club Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Armor\">Dark Armor</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\"><img alt=\"Stone Golem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Golem_9e60ec.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golem</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">270</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">110 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-40× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sulphurous%20Stone\">Sulphurous Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Ring\">Power Ring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Sword\">Carlin Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Ancient Stone (rare)</li>\n<li>Shiny Stone (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Marble%20Rock\">Piece of Marble Rock</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ring\">Crystal Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest"]}